    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Grotesques",
    "summary": "In [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), as this unit is **selected to fight**, you can Empower it by spending 1 [Pain token](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). While it is Empowered, the melee weapons its models carry get **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**, and their S becomes 8.",
